  + G04 selected-schema encoding Windows setup identity canary grammar independent observer network-local refusal and live receipts remain open
  + G05 is narrowed to a method-closed carrier with forbidden variants unrepresentable but its Rust type and schema binding remain open
  + G06 exact disposable fixture roots lifecycle cleanup recovery and owner remain open
